    "detailed_description": "Resistance Survivors is a fantasy-style leisurely Roguelike game with two game modes.<br><br>In both modes, there is a system for strengthening character skills, and characters can be strengthened by upgrading different skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122720/extras/4b360f26e34695ba54d20cc7bf919e29.avif?t=1726740070\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Resistance Mode: In this mode, players play the role of a summoner who summons monsters.<br><br>There are 6 types of monsters that need to be selected before the game starts. After clearing different levels of difficulty, new monsters will be unlocked one after another.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122720/extras/f73ae1f149589810178f276711712bb8.avif?t=1726740070\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>In the game, 6 types of monsters are summoned to fight the heroes. If you defeat the heroes before the countdown ends, you will win.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122720/extras/f76bea887488ecf2027ae25eb713b381.avif?t=1726740070\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Survival Mode: In this mode, the player assumes the role of a hero.<br><br>Choose a hero before the game starts. After passing different levels of difficulty, new heroes will be unlocked one after another.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122720/extras/1bfd9a54a96b2d989480d41f7322b7fb.avif?t=1726740070\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>In the game, the hero wins if he survives the monster attack until the countdown ends.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122720/extras/3b959b0a081621fcb3a8200a49126487.avif?t=1726740070\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>The above is the general gameplay of the game.",
